      "role": "user",
      "content": "that's a good start. when they use words like \"eroding moral order\" or \"corrupting\" truth, it sounds like they aren't just disagreeing with new laws, but actually seeing these changes as something fundamentally wrong or even evil. can you expand on that? why do they feel that these specific shifts are so destructive to the \"moral fabric\" they mention?",
