      "content": "Traditionalist theologians believe these shifts are not merely policy disagreements but a fundamental assault on the objective moral law written into human nature and divine creation. They argue that by decoupling sex from procreation and redefining marriage as a contract of feelings rather than a covenant of complementary genders, society actively destroys the biological and spiritual reality that sustains human flourishing. This \"corruption\" is seen as evil because it replaces truth with subjective preference, leading to a chaotic world where children are abandoned to the state and human dignity is reduced to personal desire. For them, defending traditional marriage is the only way to stop this moral decay from unraveling the very structure of civilization.",
